Output "/var/tmp/sesync-demo/out/tui-sessions.mp4"
Source common.tape
Hide
Type ". /var/tmp/sesync-demo/env.sh; rm -f ~/.config/sesync/tui.json; cd ~/projects/webshop; clear" Enter
Sleep 700ms
Show
Sleep 400ms
Type "sesync --tui" Sleep 400ms Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Down Sleep 900ms Down Sleep 900ms Down Sleep 900ms Up Sleep 500ms Up Sleep 500ms Up Sleep 900ms
Enter Sleep 1.2s
Down Sleep 300ms Down Sleep 300ms Down Sleep 900ms
Enter Sleep 1.2s
Space Sleep 500ms Down Sleep 300ms Space Sleep 900ms
Enter Sleep 6s
Type "f" Sleep 1.5s Type "f" Sleep 1.5s Type "f" Sleep 1.5s Type "f" Sleep 1.2s
Type "/" Sleep 400ms Type "rate" Sleep 1.8s Escape Sleep 1s Escape Sleep 800ms
Tab Sleep 2.2s Tab Sleep 2.5s Tab Sleep 1.5s
Type "q" Sleep 500ms
